    # Verify that invocationState was passed through hooks and toolContext
    # We check that agent._invoke_async was called with invocationState in kwargs
    # Since we patched _invoke_async, we can check if it received invocationState
    # But since we replaced the method, we can't directly check call args here without mock
    # So we rely on no error and response presence as success


